        "q": "How do I record a triathlon in HealthKit?",
        "a": "With the two multisport constants Apple added in iOS 16.0. swimBikeRun is documented for multisport activities like triathlons, and transition covers the transition time between activities in a multisport workout. Using swimBikeRun without transition leaves the time between legs attributed to nothing at all."
